<title>CANADA: Anchor Lamina to buy back 750,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Anchor Lamina to buy back 750,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>WINDSOR, Ontario 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anchor Lamina Inc said on Wednesday that it intends to repurchase up to 750,000 of its common shares over the next 12 months.</p>
<p>The share buyback would represent about 3.2 percent of the company's 23 million outstanding common shares, Anchor said in a statement.</p>
<p>The repurchase will be conducted between September 20, 1996 and September 19, 1997.</p>
<p>Anchor's stock was trading unchanged at 5.25 on the Toronto Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
